		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=34755#p34755"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>Désolé pour lé raponse tardive j&#039;étais en vacances <img src="http://forums.postgresql.fr/img/smilies/big_smile.png" width="15" height="15" alt="big_smile" /></p><p>Voici le résultat de la requete :</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; name&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | setting | unit |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; category&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;short_desc&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;extra_desc&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; context&#160; | vartype |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;source&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| min_val |&#160; max_val&#160; &#160;| enumvals | boot_val | reset_val |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; sourcefile&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| sourceline | pending_restart<br />----------------------------+---------+------+-------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------------------------------+-----------+---------+--------------------+---------+------------+----------+----------+-----------+-----------------------------------+------------+-----------------<br /> log_min_duration_statement | 1000&#160; &#160; | ms&#160; &#160;| Reporting and Logging / When to Log | Sets the minimum execution time above which all statements will be logged. | Zero prints all queries. -1 turns this feature off. | superuser | integer | configuration file | -1&#160; &#160; &#160; | 2147483647 |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | -1&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| 1000&#160; &#160; &#160; | /data/biohub/postgresql.auto.conf |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 6 | f</p><br /><p>Oui j&#039;ai bien rechargé la config et aussi redémarré la base....</p>]]></content>
